Every clinician may discuss a continued-opioid-benefit-perception with a patient.
Every clinician may discuss a continued-opioid-risk-perception with a patient.
Every clinician may discuss a continued-opioid-adverse-effect-perception with a patient.
Every clinician may include a patient-concern in a taper-plan.
Every clinician may include a patient in a medication-first-decrease-decision.
Every clinician may include a patient in a taper-speed-decision.
